      "content": "17.2 Space – APJ Abdul Kalam Island"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "tzrfb22",
      "content": "APJ Abdul Kalam Island (formerly Wheeler Island) is India's premier missile test facility located off the coast of Balasore district in Odisha. It is managed by DRDO's ITR (Integrated Test Range). Major missiles tested here include Agni series, Prithvi, Akash, Nag, and Brahmos."
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "APJ Abdul Kalam Island (formerly Wheeler Island) in Odisha is frequently tested as India's premier integrated missile test range.",
        "Defence and space developments involving DRDO and ISRO are high-yield topics for national competitive exams.",
        "Key initiatives in IT & Electronics, including semiconductor missions and digital infrastructure, are regular features in current affairs questions."
      ],
      "id": "4l25at0"
